  copy through the chokepoint" from different angles. Item 5 ("hub-host
  path agreement with stub") is parent install-service material. Compress
  to 3-4 falsifiable domain criteria.
  Traces to: `outcomes.desired` | Brevity Contract caps + Sibling-redundancy
  Misalignment: spec-bloat
  Category: Brevity, Sibling-redundancy

