  example with the seven methodology doc names baked in. Forbidden content.
  Traces to: `outcomes.undesired` | Brevity Contract caps + Forbidden content (file paths)
  Misalignment: spec-bloat
  Category: Forbidden-content

- [ ] `## Strategy` has 5 decisions (at cap) but each runs 200+ words. Trim.
  Traces to: `## Strategy` | Brevity Contract per-decision caps
  Misalignment: spec-bloat
  Category: Brevity

- [ ] `## Bad examples` reproduces a verbatim 7-element TypeScript array of
  methodology doc names — the exact pattern the contract forbids.
  Traces to: `## Bad examples` | Forbidden content (TypeScript arrays, file paths)
  Misalignment: spec-bloat
